{number: 18}
{title: I Surrender All}
{key: C}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[C] All to Jesus [G] I surrender,
[Am] All to [F] Him I [G] freely [C] give;
[C] I will ever [G] love and trust Him,
[Am] In His [F] presence [G] daily [C] live.
[C] I surrender [Dm] all, [G] I surrender [C] all; [G]
[C] All to Thee, my [F] blessed Savior,
[C] I sur-[G] render [C] all.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[C] All to Jesus [G] I surrender,
[Am] Make me, [F] Savior, [G] wholly [C] Thine;
[C] Let me feel the [G] Holy Spirit,
[Am] Truly [F] know that [G] Thou art [C] mine.
[C] I surrender [Dm] all, [G] I surrender [C] all; [G]
[C] All to Thee, my [F] blessed Savior,
[C] I sur-[G] render [C] all.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[C] All to Jesus [G] I surrender,
[Am] Lord, I [F] give my-[G] self to [C] Thee;
[C] Fill me with Thy [G] love and power,
[Am] Let Thy [F] blessing [G] fall on [C] me.
[C] I surrender [Dm] all, [G] I surrender [C] all; [G]
[C] All to Thee, my [F] blessed Savior,
[C] I sur-[G] render [C] all.
{end_of_verse}
